 "def": "D4_v1 \u00a77 S0-3 AGE-REVERT + AGE-MCT ($0; D3-T). \u00a7170 test items n 1..8 (vbank_eval.part_acc's chunks). D in {2, 4}: passes 1..D compute V_t and then\nstore an EDITED entry (rollout(edit=...); SLVA / the bank read the stored entry); normal passes follow; acc read at K' D + n - 1 (acc_k_pre) and\nK' D + n + 2 (acc_n2) from one rollout per chunk. REVERT: at pass t <= D, real slots whose argmax R(V_t[j]) differs from the decode of the previous\nSTORED entry S_{t-1}[j] are set back to S_{t-1}[j] (S_0 = V_0; under CARRY the carry gets the same entry). MCT: at pass t <= D the stored entry is\nm.mct(V_t, E_0, pad, mu 1.0) (the no_grad minimum-norm edit in R's row space, so R decodes E_0 at every real slot; every slot keeps its aged vector).\nintact = acc at K' n + 2 (the runner gates it against eval_vb.json acc_n2, bitwise on the eval card). Exposure: reverted slot-events per item (REVERT),\nand the share of MCT stored entries decoding E_0 at every real slot.",
 "run": "boxes/runs_fsq/s213_d3t_s1",
 "mode": "slva",
 "eval_bs": 32,
 "dtype": "fp32",
 "per_n": 1000,
 "card": "NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3070",
 "sec": 176
}